<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94880" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκινδάλᾰμος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰλ]</span>, 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχινδάλᾰμος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>splinter</i>,
			in form 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχινδαλμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					2.133
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκινδαλαμός, σχιδαλαμός</span>,
			etc. in codd.); <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκινδαλμός</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγων ἀκριβῶν σχινδάλαμοι</span>
			strawsplittings, quibbles, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				130
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ra.</u>
				819
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Hes.</u>
				5
			</span></i>; so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκινδαλμούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					3.64
				</span></i>
			:—cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνασχινδυλεύω</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
